===Punctuation mark===
{{head|hy|punctuation mark}}

# [[Armenian]] [[abbreviation]] mark. It was placed on top of the part of the word to indicate that it was abbreviated. Called {{m|hy|պատիվ|}} in Armenian.

====Usage notes====
* Not used in modern Armenian.
* The sign should be placed on top of a letter, but most current fonts do not do that: they show it following a letter, e.g. {{m|xcl||Ած՟}}.
* The most common abbreviations were:
*: {{m|xcl||Ած՟}} = {{m|xcl|աստուած|Աստուած}}
*: {{m|xcl||Այ՟}} = {{m|xcl|աստուածոյ|Աստուածոյ}}
*: {{m|xcl||յԱյ՟}} = {{m|xcl|յաստուածոյ|յԱստուածոյ}}
*: {{m|xcl||Ավ՟}} = {{m|xcl|աստուած|Աստուածով}}
*: {{m|xcl||ամ՟}} = {{m|xcl|ամենայն}}
*: {{m|xcl||պտ՟}} = {{m|xcl|պատասխանի}}
*: {{m|xcl||սբ՟}} = {{m|xcl|սուրբ}}
*: {{m|xcl||-ութի՟}} = {{m|xcl|-ութիւն}}, {{m|xcl||-ութե՟}} = {{m|xcl||-ութեան}}, {{m|xcl||-ութէ՟}} = {{m|xcl||-ութենէ}}

